textkit utf16: say encode or decode
Options:
  --big          Write or read big-endian code units (default little-endian)
  --bom          Begin the encoded output with a byte order mark
  --hex          Write or read code units as hex numbers, one line of text per line
  --limit <int>  The most bytes to read, all inputs together (default 8388608)
Arguments:
  <args>...      encode or decode, then the files to read; none, or -, is standard input
